Original Appleseed history
==========================

Messages below are preserved verbatim, apart from indentation. They are
provenance for the consolidated patches, not claims that the original
commit patches apply unchanged to the selected upstream base.

The compatibility baseline includes the combined history through
b0f1c08e2a1fe95139c994525fb6021f97c7d892. Its net changes are split by
dependency modules, native build targets, library APIs, shader APIs,
and support files. Some older changes were already upstream or were
superseded before that checkpoint.

